TICKET-303: Security review & privacy hardening

Priority: P0 · Estimate: 2 pts · Depends on: 202

- Verify: TLS everywhere, tokens encrypted at rest, no PII in logs (email bodies never logged), ProGuard/R8 enabled, dependency vulnerability scan (Dependabot) enabled
- Data retention policy: raw email bodies never persisted server-side beyond the request; only summaries cached
- Document what data lives where in `docs/privacy.md`
